 "remarks": "Location, location, location! Beautifully maintained, updated 2-bedroom, 1.5-bath corner-unit townhouse offering 944 sq. ft. across two levels on the edge of East Norwalk. Nestled in a quiet, friendly, and well-cared-for community, this home blends a relaxed coastal vibe with ultimate city convenience. Hop on your bike for a quick ride to Calf Pasture and Shady beaches, or stroll to nearby Veterans Memorial Park and Marina. You are also within easy walking distance to South Norwalk's vibrant Washington Street restaurants, cafes, shops, Maritime Aquarium, and The SoNo Collection. Commuters will love being just 0.5 miles to East Norwalk Metro-North (1.1 miles to SoNo Station), with quick access to I-95 and Route 7.  Inside, natural light fills the open living space. The updated kitchen features new cabinetry, quartz countertops, newer stainless steel appliances, and a main-level half bath. Sliding doors open to a private patio for summer grilling. Upstairs, two large bedrooms join a full bath and in-unit laundry. The primary bedroom offers views of Veterans Park and Long Island Sound. Complete with attic storage, dedicated bike storage, two assigned parking spots (one right by the door), and landscaped grounds. Meticulously maintained, freshly painted, and professionally cleaned, this turnkey home is ready for conscientious residents looking for a vibrant, coastal lifestyle!",
